
### 1. GET All Transactions
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions


### 2. GET Transaction by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions/1


### 3. POST Create Transaction
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Uang Saku",
  "amount": 1000000,
  "type": "income",
  "category": "Allowance",
  "date": "2026-11-23"
}


### 4. PATCH Update Transaction
PATCH http://localhost:3000/transactions/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Uang Saku Bulanan",
  "amount": 1200000
}


### 5. DELETE Transaction
DELETE http://localhost:3000/transactions/6


### 6. Validation Error
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "AB",
  "amount": -100,
  "type": "saving",
  "category": "",
  "date": "tanggal-salah"
}


### 7. Not Found Exception
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions/999